<title>AUSTRALIA: Biggest gains/falls for ASX 100 index in last week.</title>
<headline>Biggest gains/falls for ASX 100 index in last week.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following is a list of the 10 largest gaining and falling stocks for Australian companies included in the Australian Stock Exchange's ASX 100 index for the week to April 11.</p>
<p>Top 10 largest gains in week</p>
<p>Rank Name			  Price     pct change</p>
<p>1   Burswood		     1.52	     16.92</p>
<p>2   Village Roadshow	   4.53	     12.13</p>
<p>3   Brambles		    21.85		8.98</p>
<p>4   Qantas			 2.56		8.02</p>
